  "description": "*“Did I steal this man's lover?”* \n\nSeo In-Ho wakes up in a world that he doesn’t recognize. He cannot speak, and can hardly move, but hears voices calling out for him…only, it’s by a name he doesn’t know. Realizing that he has possessed the body of Kacius of this nation’s royal guard. The only person he can rely on is Kacius’s former colleague and lover, Albretto Noe. Determined to not only be protected by, but to protect Albretto, In-Ho begins to fall deeper and deeper into the life of Kacius, until it becomes nigh impossible to differentiate who he truly is any longer…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
